calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Thomas County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2026 so far, March to April sat at 32% of normal on the middle of the grids, and June to July came back at 115%. Grid 26517 had its driest year in 1989 at 46% of normal.</p>"}
